      </li>
      </ol>
      <h4 id="kmm-gathering-data-for-kmm-hub_kernel-module-management-operator" class="group scroll-mt-20">Gathering data for KMM-Hub<a href="#kmm-gathering-data-for-kmm-hub_kernel-module-management-operator" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h4>
      <p class="_abstract">To collect diagnostic data for the KMM-Hub Operator on OpenShift Container Platform, you can run the <code>must-gather</code> tool with the hub controller image and review Operator logs.</p>
      <p><strong>Procedure</strong></p>
      <ol>
      <li>
      Gather the data for the KMM Operator hub controller manager:
      <ol>
      <li>
      Set the <code>MUST_GATHER_IMAGE</code> variable:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ export MUST_GATHER_IMAGE=$(oc get deployment -n openshift-kmm-hub kmm-operator-hub-controller -ojsonpath='{.spec.template.spec.containers[?(@.name==\"manager\")].env[?(@.name==\"RELATED_IMAGE_MUST_GATHER\")].value}')"} lang="terminal" />
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc adm must-gather --image=\"${MUST_GATHER_IMAGE}\" -- /usr/bin/gather -u"} lang="terminal" />
      <Alert variant="note" class="my-4">
        <AlertTitle>Note</AlertTitle>
        <AlertDescription>
          <p>Use the <code>-n &lt;namespace&gt;</code> switch to specify a namespace if you installed KMM in a custom namespace.</p>
        </AlertDescription>
      </Alert>
      </li>
      <li>
      Run the <code>must-gather</code> tool:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc adm must-gather --image=\"${MUST_GATHER_IMAGE}\" -- /usr/bin/gather -u"} lang="terminal" />
      </li>
      </ol>
      </li>
      <li>
      View the Operator logs:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc logs -fn openshift-kmm-hub deployments/kmm-operator-hub-controller"} lang="terminal" />
